{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1561368-how-to-overpower-the-protection-intimacys-give-on-social-maneuvering","id":1561368,"title":"How to overpower the protection Intimacys give on social maneuvering","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-07-05T21:12:32-07:00","id":1561368,"title":"How to overpower the protection Intimacys give on social maneuvering","content":"only means I can see currently are Celestial bliss trick and twisted words technique","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-06T08:50:36-07:00","id":1561382,"title":"","content":"Find something to pull the other way is the cheap way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-06T10:57:33-07:00","id":1561388,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1561368-how-to-overpower-the-protection-intimacys-give-on-social-maneuvering#post1561368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">only means I can see currently are Celestial bliss trick and twisted words technique</div> </div> </div> </div>What do you mean by &quot;overpower&quot;, and is it something to reconcile the intentions behind why the influence system runs on Intimacies in the first place?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-06T13:01:31-07:00","id":1561398,"title":"","content":"Generally, you don't. The mechanical philosophy of social combat is to treat Intimacies not as an obstacle to overcome, but as the foundation and scaffolding around which social combat is built. If you want to change someone's behavior, you don't (usually) use your divine charisma to bypass them entirely, but to change them over time.<br /> <br /> The core technique my most social PC (an aspiring god-queen) relies on for long-term social power is laddering. While having pre-existing Intimacies to play off of is obviously convenient and expedient, you *can* produce Minor Intimacies without other scaffolding, and while you can only alter a given Intimacy's intensity once per story, you can affect multiple *different* Intimacies in the same story. So you build 2+ synergistic Minor Intimacies in the first story, use them as the basis to build both to Major in the next, and can boost one or both up to Defining in a third.<br /> <br /> The fun thing is that doing this quite naturally represents real-world social tactics, even if it turns them up to eleven through Exalted power. For a straightforward example, think of the propaganda dictators use to build cults of personality. You agitate fears and grievances in the public towards political enemies or useful scapegoats, and then sell yourself as the only one who can make their world right again. Through sustaining and amplifying that messaging over months or years by exaggerating and spreading word of new incidents and the steps you've taken to &quot;fight back,&quot; you can take people who'd otherwise have gone about their business never thinking of you, and turn them into a frothing mob who will risk their lives to put or keep you in power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28948-mj6373","name":"MJ6373","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-08T23:09:00-07:00","id":1561502,"title":"","content":"Should have said circumvent not overpower wanting a intimacy for the immaculate philosophy to tottaly immunize someone from social maneuvering by celestial exalted<br /> <br /> <br /> only ways I see to do that are the two charms I mentioned and the biggie them not know of your exalted status","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-10T02:20:58-07:00","id":1561561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1561368-how-to-overpower-the-protection-intimacys-give-on-social-maneuvering?p=1561502#post1561502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> only ways I see to do that are the two charms I mentioned</div> </div> </div> </div>So... are you asking for things that would result in an outcome you don't want?<br /> <br /> On the one hand, sure, there's little in the way of Charms even for Solars to just skip around a dedicated adherence to something that would be contrary to the intentions of Solars. And Dragon-Blooded have Integrity Charms to reinforce their Intimacies even further.<br /> <br /> On the other, the only way for a person to be &quot;totally immunized&quot; against being influenced is if they have some capacity to be incapable of changing Intimacies or forming new ones. Changing the perspective of a dedicated monk is challenging, but it's still not in keeping with the dramatic intentions of the game to be completely impossible. It's just a matter of finding or building other values for them and developing those to a point where they can be leveraged towards weakening the contrary Intimacies.<br /> <br /> Although I suppose another avenue that is a bit lateral is a character engineering circumstances that consistently prevent another character from acting in accordance with the Intimacy such that it logically weakens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-10T04:01:08-07:00","id":1561564,"title":"","content":"That's not as clarifying as I think you're hoping for. What type of Intimacy is it? What's its strength level? What other Intimacies might matter? What's the context?<br /> <br /> An Immaculate monk with a Defining Principle to follow the Immaculate Philosophy doesn't get to treat every social roll from a Celestial Exalted as an unacceptable influence that they can just ignore. First things first, they would have to actually know what's being asked of them would be aiding an anathema. If you're a Celestial trying to talk an IO monk into doing something, not telling them what you are is a pretty good first start and blunts their ability to appeal to such an Intimacy for blanket protection. Then, of course, what you're asking them to do matters. A Lunar trying to convince said monk to rally the Wyld Hunt against an Abyssal encamped near by is a wildly different ask than trying to convince them to leave the Immaculate faithful. This is where learning their existing Intimacies and the ability (either mundane or Charm based) to put in ones of your choosing gets powerful in social interactions. Does the monk have strong ties to their family that can get them to bend some rules? Or a strong hatred of a House that can motivate them to look into said Houses impious actions instead of worrying about a clearly spurious claim of an anathema operating somewhere close?<br /> <br /> As long as you're not pushing your target into unacceptable influence territory... than you can generally win with big dice-pools and some creativity; maybe some time too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-12T15:41:57-07:00","id":1561643,"title":"","content":"I may be misreading you, but it feels like your concerns are the system working as intended. The previous edition introduced intimacies, but made them relatively weak: short of suicidal orders or going against your Motivation, influence had few limits and even ridiculous commands could wear down your willpower with only a +1 or +2 difficulty modifier. The decision by the original 3e dev team to make Intimacies more definitive in what you can and cannot be talked into is a reaction to this, and I have yet to be convinced it's a hypercorrection.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-17T05:24:40-07:00","id":1561817,"title":"","content":"Using threaten actions can be useful for creating/building upon a point of leverage. It's obviously bad for gaining followers but if you're trying to destroy someone's world view rather than kill them or get someone to do a one-off favour and then they'll never have to see you ever again it's a solid option.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-17T22:37:07-07:00","id":1561870,"title":"","content":"Does Celestial Bliss Trick enable the user to weaken Intimacys they find inconvenient since it plants an artificial Defining Intimacy","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-18T06:06:16-07:00","id":1561890,"title":"","content":"If you can wrangle a conflict between the intimacies, it should work. <span style=\"color:#ffffff\">Unleash the NTR plot, I guess.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-18T13:53:47-07:00","id":1561912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1561368-how-to-overpower-the-protection-intimacys-give-on-social-maneuvering?p=1561870#post1561870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does Celestial Bliss Trick enable the user to weaken Intimacys they find inconvenient since it plants an artificial Defining Intimacy</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel as though &quot;artificial Intimacy&quot; is the wrong way of looking at it. Celestial Bliss Trick isn't a Psyche Charm, and the Intimacy instilled proceeds logically from the interaction that the Charm entails. The expression of being a Charm comes in the form of being an empowered instil action that goes directly to a Defining Tie with some bonuses, offset a bit by being temporary. That and I think an Intimacy of &quot;lust&quot; is technically kind of limited. My read on the Persuade action is that it allows you to influence people into taking action that constitutes a performance of the Intimacy, in which case you might be able to persuade somebody towards sexual activity in circumstances where that's a really dubious idea, but little else.<br /> <br /> You can <i>bargain</i> through such an Intimacy for more varied actions in exchange for sex, but that has more caveats. Bargain actions are exchanges of value as arbitrated by the Storyteller, so it becomes a question of &quot;how much is sex with you really worth&quot;. The only bearing a level of Intimacy explicitly has on that is penalty to Resolve.<br /> <br /> But yeah, you can Instil towards weakening contrary Intimacies. I think &quot;lust&quot; can be an unobtrusive thing such that the extent to which it really contradicts certain other character traits can be limited.<br /> <br /> Like, I'm thinking about how an Immaculate Monk could reconcile lust for a Solar with other values, such as self-flagellating. The intervention of Persuade actions achieves more specific outcomes, but Intimacies are still supposed to exist in the context of characters with nuanced personalities.<br /> <br /> (In practice, I'd say the resolution of such things should favour the player character in the interests of letting them carry out their social prowess, these are more just points concerned with some appropriate times to call for limits and difficulties as well as how it might be processed in the larger setting, to the benefit of not saying Solars or even just characters with high stats can run roughshod over other people's agency.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-23T16:57:28-07:00","id":1562098,"title":"","content":"How longs it probaly take for intimacies infected with twisted tongue technique to be weakened and destroyed","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}